<rtept lat="57.1150275921" lon="-2.5438897945">
<time>2025-10-29T08:48:18Z</time>
<name>(3) Left onto indistinct path for summit cairn</name>
<desc>In 1.8 km, look out for a VERY indistinct path on your left that heads north towards the summit cairn of Hill of Fare (which should be visible to you about 100 m away on your left side). Go left to follow the rough and indistinct path through the heather to the cairn.  (3.3 km)</desc>
<sym>Flag</sym>
<type>Marks</type>
